### LeadBook CRM API tests
### Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each block.

@api = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{api}}/health

### 2. Log in with the demo account (run "npm run seed" first)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@leadbook.test", "password": "demo1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. List contacts
GET {{api}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create a lead / deal
POST {{api}}/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Lead", "company": "Test Co", "deal": "Website", "value": 40000, "stage": "new", "source": "Website" }

### 5. List tasks
GET {{api}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Email automation: rules, today's queue and log
GET {{api}}/automation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
